Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.54,0:00:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.72,0:00:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear what you're saying right now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally starting to lose\Nyour hearing, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously, I just told him my next pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna win with a\Nhigh outside fastball.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.40,0:00:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Jotaro, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.52,0:00:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.76,0:00:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or will you doubt me instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.79,0:00:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not too bright, are you?
