Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand peers into\Nyour soul the same way a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thermal imager detects\Nan object's radiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.58,0:00:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what you will, your soul cannot lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.76,0:00:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless of what it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.36,0:00:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by analyzing your soul I can see the\Nanswer to any yes or no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.82,0:00:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right or left, high or\Nlow, outside or inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.76,0:00:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fastball or curveball, my\Nstand's perception is infallible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not to be the only\None who is the only
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.45,0:01:06.29,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,952.999)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one who is the one who
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.96,0:01:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is the one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.88,0:01:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.66,0:01:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has been.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.57,0:01:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still in love with\Nthe power of the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.20,0:01:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how many men are looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.06,0:01:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not still looking for
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.32,0:01:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the chance to reach the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.10,0:01:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still looking for the\Nmoment when I'm in a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.04,0:01:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be able to shoot\Nthe sword of the dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.54,0:01:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop. It's now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was the story of the\Ntale that's been taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.86,0:01:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.52,0:01:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.02,0:01:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the next time. The Crusaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.86,0:02:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last page.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.94,0:02:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.44,0:02:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.78,0:02:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.14,0:02:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.74,0:02:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ola Ola Ola Ola!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.56,0:02:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will your pitch be a\Nhigh outside fastball?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.00,0:02:36.63,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(650,639)\pos(146,858)}Episode 42: The Miasma of the Void, Cool Ice, Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.14,0:02:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Chotaro's telling\Nthe truth after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's really going to pitch\Na high outside fastball.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.52,0:02:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true that he beat\Nmy brother by bluffing,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he's a fool if he thinks the\Nsame tired tactic will work with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.66,0:02:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.86,0:03:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your sake,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you haven't forgotten that you'll\Nlose the game if you fall 11 runs behind.
