Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.96,0:03:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hits but it's a grounder the\Nball is thrown to first and out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.04,0:03:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just no way everything about\Nhim said he was going to throw a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.56,0:03:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,high outside fastball His soul can't\Nlie no one's can not a zen master not
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.14,0:03:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even my brother and he's the world's\Ngreatest Con man next up is another
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.32,0:03:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell! He's telling the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, you have the goal to\Ncheat your way to victory?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.72,0:04:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He actually is cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.42,0:04:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello! Inside forkball!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a flyball heading\Nfor the pitcher! Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.52,0:04:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have cheated!\NAdmit it! You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.08,0:04:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You clearly tampered with the console!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.40,0:04:24.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.32,0:04:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're cheating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.78,0:04:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you just come clean already?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.26,0:04:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No response. Damn it! That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.74,0:04:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only have use of my power if\NI ask him a yes or no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.90,0:04:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging from your scared expression,\Nyour power requires a yes or no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.38,0:04:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just like your brother said...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just a dance of deception\Nwhere the loser cries first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.42,0:04:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dance, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.74,0:05:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is nothing but a game to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.44,0:05:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you taking me for a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.38,0:05:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you any idea who you're speaking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.88,0:05:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, pitch the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.08,0:05:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll figure out your little trick\Nand take your soul as my prize!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.08,0:05:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.99,0:05:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.36,0:05:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For my next pitch, I'll throw\Na high outside fastball.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.74,0:05:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once again, his soul says\Nhe's telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's really going to pitch\Na high outside fastball.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.14,0:05:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had about as much\Nof this as I can take.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.68,0:05:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll figure out how you're cheating\Nif it's the last thing I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Jyotaro hasn't changed his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.98,0:05:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still dead set on\Nthrowing that infernal pitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.42,0:05:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.12,0:05:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So far, it's still a fastball,\Nand his soul is saying yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It changed direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.98,0:06:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A forkball!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.12,0:06:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.03,0:06:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a different pitch now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.72,0:06:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.47,0:06:12.47,SC42 Sign 1,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,650)}Bottom of the 1st
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.41,0:06:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's three outs! Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.28,0:06:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.78,0:06:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I figure out how he's cheating?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.98,0:06:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro's soul kept saying\Nhe'd throw a fastball,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.28,0:06:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but at the last second it\Ncurved into a forkball.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.96,0:06:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.63,0:06:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is this wretch deceiving me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.88,0:06:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to lose this game, Darby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.52,0:06:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me why you removed your stupid hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm more perceptive than\Nyou think I know you've
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been cheating ever since\Nyou took it off now move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.34,0:06:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to check your\Nstation and controller
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:06:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing here, damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.76,0:07:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have something to\Ndo with that hat of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.42,0:07:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be evidence\Naround here somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.58,0:07:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're using Star Platinum\Nto cheat, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.70,0:07:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.78,0:07:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just admit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're doing something!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.28,0:07:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can clearly read Jotaro's thoughts!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.72,0:07:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means my stand's power\Nis still working as it should!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how can his mind say one\Nthing but his body do another?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.00,0:07:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro, are you seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.44,0:07:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's losing his youthful glow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.74,0:07:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He definitely doesn't look\Nlike a guy in his 20s anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.14,0:07:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darby, it's your turn to pitch, so hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.16,0:07:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 4 to 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.34,0:07:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With only a one-point difference,\NI might still have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.86,0:07:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a video game genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.88,0:07:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.02,0:07:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a video game genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.32,0:08:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've won every game I've ever played.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.28,0:08:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A video game expert is an expert at life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.14,0:08:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can shake\Nmy confidence so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.78,0:08:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that! Another home run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.86,0:08:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's another run for the Jaguars, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.36,0:08:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's five-to-three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.84,0:08:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.06,0:08:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I accidentally released his\Nsoul from the doll! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.28,0:08:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His soul has returned to his body!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's regaining consciousness!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.14,0:08:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! I didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.80,0:08:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never once admitted defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.64,0:08:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was an accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to release\Nhis soul from the doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.64,0:08:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the thing is, you\Ndid release his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.44,0:08:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.86,0:08:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your soul admitted defeat\Nand it's game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.92,0:08:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hold on. This...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.46,0:09:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is Joseph's Stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was wrapped around the\Ncontroller the entire time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Whoops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I forgot to put this away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.80,0:09:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could something so stupid...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.22,0:09:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean it was Joseph?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was the cheater all along? Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.26,0:09:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro is telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He really wasn't controlling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.98,0:09:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was you, Joseph Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.06,0:09:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too bad you're not your\Nbrother because if you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.20,0:09:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were you would have\Nfigured it out a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ago by the way old man
