Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.14,0:09:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're pretty clever
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.62,0:09:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i didn't expect you to catch on to my idea
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as quickly as you did\Nwell of course i did my
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.14,0:09:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,boy i can read you like a book you are my
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.94,0:09:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandson after all. Now up\Nand at him. Cock you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.98,0:09:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,joseph was controlling things from behind
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:10:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before i forget what to\Ndo with you you button
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.10,0:10:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-mashing jerk oh shit\Nplease mercy i beg you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.30,0:10:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i've already given you\Nback cock you in seoul
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.46,0:10:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,haven't i it's like\Nthey say no harm no foul
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.24,0:10:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're good right right\Nright you want to know
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.66,0:10:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whether i'll forgive\Nyou why don't Why don't
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.62,0:10:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you just do what you do\Nbest and read my mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.80,0:10:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will I hit you with my right fist\Nor decide to deck you with my left?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.12,0:10:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.56,0:10:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, since you're asking,\Nyou'll use your right one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.72,0:10:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then your left?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.74,0:10:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.70,0:10:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna use both, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.38,0:10:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.38,0:10:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.46,0:10:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna do the Aurora thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.84,0:10:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.66,0:10:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.01,0:10:59.01,SC42 Sign 2,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(545,448.8)}D'Arby Younger
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.01,0:10:59.01,SC42 Sign 2,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(545,520)}Out of commission
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darby Younger, out of commission!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.78,0:11:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We broke through some sort of wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's our ticket out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.02,0:11:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro! Cock you in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.46,0:11:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for disturbing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Your Excellence, as\NI'm sure you're aware,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and his comrades have\Njust infiltrated the manor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.76,0:11:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regrettably, I must also inform\Nyou that Darby has been defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.30,0:11:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but Darby was a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.60,0:11:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could one as gifted as Darby fail me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.64,0:11:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, I'd like to hear your thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.42,0:11:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may enter Cool Ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.68,0:12:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever the obstacle,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whatever the danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.70,0:12:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Joestars are prepared to sacrifice\Ntheir lives in order to save their family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.44,0:12:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin and the other two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.40,0:12:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were their names again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.48,0:12:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.86,0:12:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe it's Avdol and Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.74,0:12:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're willing to surrender their lives\Nfor the eradication of yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They believe fleeing from me is somehow\Nthe same as running from themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.02,0:12:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fools, one and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.56,0:12:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nonetheless, the fools find\Nstrength in this misguided belief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darby swore his undying loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.56,0:12:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately, he was not\Nprepared to actually die on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:13:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is why, at the edge of glory,\Nvictory slipped through his fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.66,0:13:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the rest of eternity,\NDarby will remain in ignorance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.50,0:13:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice, have a look at the scar on my neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.06,0:13:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jonathan Joestar's body\Nis still rejecting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.02,0:13:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I need the blood of one more soul\Nbefore this body truly becomes mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.44,0:13:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once that happens,\Nthe wound will heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice, will you offer me the crimson\Nvigor coursing through your veins?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.82,0:13:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it'd be an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.98,0:13:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is mine is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.94,0:14:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you beheaded yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.46,0:14:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.28,0:14:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What cool ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.52,0:14:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot accept the blood\Nof such a loyal servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.10,0:14:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My wound shall be healed, but it\Nwill be with the blood of another.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.90,0:14:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, you must live.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.48,0:14:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So awaken and be reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.06,0:14:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your steadfast resolve shall secure\Nyour victory over those who'd oppose me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.72,0:14:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall not fail you, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.28,0:14:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No weapon can surpass one's own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are ready, Kulice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go and attend to our unwanted guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.26,0:14:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, Lord Dio, I\Nwill not let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.04,0:14:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.18,0:15:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I sincerely hope that for your sake,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.02,0:15:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your next victim into the void will be\None of the Joestars and not my boudoir.
