Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.50,0:15:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ten minutes he gave us are up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.50,0:15:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.60,0:15:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar ordered us to\Nset the mansion on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.06,0:15:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I say we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.56,0:15:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to find them. Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.58,0:15:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, before we proceed,\Nthere's something I need to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.20,0:15:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.48,0:15:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you lose your way, get injured, or\Ncan't go on, I won't come to your rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.18,0:15:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.09,0:15:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.06,0:16:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same for you, Iggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that might sound cruel,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.14,0:16:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but remember the reason we're here\Nis to defeat Dio once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.80,0:16:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And of course, the same rules\Nmust apply to me as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.96,0:16:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm injured or separated from\Nyou, you have to promise you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.92,0:16:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,won't attempt to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.12,0:16:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Above all else, you must\Nthink of your own safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.36,0:16:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let ourselves get killed\Ntrying to save one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.60,0:16:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's too much at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oui, that's how it goes then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.28,0:16:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we get out of this alive, you're\Ntreating me to one hell of a meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.26,0:16:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll treat you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do your thing, Silver Chariot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.76,0:17:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Avdol, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.32,0:17:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place looks like it goes on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.44,0:17:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar told us to set\Nthe mansion on fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.86,0:17:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but setting this immense labyrinth ablaze\Nwould end up putting us all in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.32,0:17:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So instead...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magicians Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These flames detect life forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.58,0:17:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can sense anything alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.02,0:17:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,detecting even cutaneous\Nrespiration and minute movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.86,0:17:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These flames can also sense a stand's\Nenergy, so we'll let them lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any particular reason\Nthere are six flames?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's one for each direction,\Nas well as for above and below.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.50,0:17:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there is anything\Nhidden within 15 meters,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.54,0:18:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,regardless of its size, the flame will\Ndetect its presence and alert us immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.14,0:18:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.05,0:18:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and the others\Nwere pulled below us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.98,0:18:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The flames are picking up on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.06,0:18:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently it's in\Nfront of us to the left!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.00,0:18:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.54,0:18:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.46,0:18:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's this guy supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.92,0:18:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, do you see what's\Nhappening, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.31,0:18:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The maze!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.23,0:18:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's totally disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to bet the power\Nof this man stand created the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.16,0:18:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,illusion of the maze it dissipated\Nas soon as Iggy slashed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.96,0:18:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name Billy Jean his\Nfate instant defeat.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.10,0:18:53.15,SC42 Sign 3,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(1248,840)}Name: Billie Jean \NStand Power: Illusions  \NInstant Defeat
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.78,0:18:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mansion is back to normal now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.14,0:18:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we averted at least\None potential crisis and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.38,0:19:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the flames don't seem to\Nbe sensing any danger?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.24,0:19:06.12,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs57)}The moment you turn around...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.34,0:19:18.22,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs57)}...you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.98,0:19:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The flames don't sense a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.32,0:19:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Iggy hasn't picked\Nup on anything either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.68,0:19:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My god!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.18,0:19:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that abomination?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.00,0:19:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither my flames nor Iggy could sense it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.94,0:19:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did it come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.32,0:19:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, Iggy, you have\Nto get out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.45,0:20:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Avdol? The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.76,0:20:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that thing? Where did it...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.66,0:20:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.84,0:20:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whose arms are…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.36,0:20:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Avdol, where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.32,0:20:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.40,0:20:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, come out, Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.56,0:20:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.76,0:20:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did it come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.24,0:20:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weren't Avdol's flames supposed\Nto be able to sense anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.44,0:20:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Iggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.96,0:20:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't your nose pick up on this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.28,0:20:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.70,0:20:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.72,0:20:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.46,0:20:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:20:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.26,0:21:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has been reduced to nothingness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.54,0:21:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beyond my jaws lies an endless\Nvoid, a dark dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.54,0:21:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which harbors things even\NI do not fully comprehend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.52,0:21:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your ally is dead but fret\Nnot as you will soon join him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.16,0:21:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were arrogant enough to\Nbelieve you could defeat Lord Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.56,0:21:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore you must be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.52,0:21:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One by one,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.22,0:21:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,each of you shall fall in\Nline as I scatter your atomic
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.98,0:21:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fragments across the deepest\Nrecesses of the Void.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.92,0:21:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.18,0:21:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you killed Abbacchio.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.42,0:21:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you lie to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.42,0:22:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.38,0:22:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
